{"id":"8940b60e44b8fbd8","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-recursion-operator.md","title":"Recursion Operator","display":"df-recursion-operator — Recursion Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-recursion-operator","aliases":["92-df-recursion-operator"],"display":"df-recursion-operator — Recursion Operator","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-recursion-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-recursion-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursion-operator — Recursion Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (parameter arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> (partial base function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> (partial step function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{g,h},\\mathrm{RecOp}_k\">\\(\\Gamma_{g,h},\\mathrm{RecOp}_k\\)</span> (definition-target recursion graph and operator)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_{g,h}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{H\\subseteq(\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N\\ \\Bigm|\\ {}&amp;\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\;((\\vec x,0),g(\\vec x))\\in H\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\,\\forall n,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(((\\vec x,n),y)\\in H\\land(\\vec x,n,y)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\Longrightarrow((\\vec x,n+1),h(\\vec x,n,y))\\in H\\bigr)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h)&amp;:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{graph}(\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h))\\coloneqq\\Gamma_{g,h}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_{g,h}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{H\\subseteq(\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N\\ \\Bigm|\\ {}&amp;\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\;((\\vec x,0),g(\\vec x))\\in H\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\,\\forall n,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(((\\vec x,n),y)\\in H\\land(\\vec x,n,y)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\Longrightarrow((\\vec x,n+1),h(\\vec x,n,y))\\in H\\bigr)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h)&amp;:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{graph}(\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h))\\coloneqq\\Gamma_{g,h}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>递归操作：从基函数和步函数定义新函数</li>\n<li>基础情形：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\vec x,0)=g(\\vec x)\">\\(f(\\vec x,0)=g(\\vec x)\\)</span></li>\n<li>递归情形：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\vec x,n+1)=h(\\vec x,n,f(\\vec x,n))\">\\(f(\\vec x,n+1)=h(\\vec x,n,f(\\vec x,n))\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是允许部分基函数和部分步函数的一般递归算子；限制到总函数时得到原始递归算子的底层方程</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{g,h}\">\\(\\Gamma_{g,h}\\)</span> 按递归参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 分层生成，因而是函数图；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h\">\\(g,h\\)</span> 总定义，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h)\\)</span> 也总定义</li>\n<li>用于构造原始递归函数类</li>\n<li>与最小化操作不同，它按自然数参数逐层生成；只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h\">\\(g,h\\)</span> 总定义时才保证结果总定义</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{g,h},\\mathrm{RecOp}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_{g,h}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{H\\subseteq(\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N\\ \\Bigm|\\ {}&\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\;((\\vec x,0),g(\\vec x))\\in H\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\,\\forall n,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(((\\vec x,n),y)\\in H\\land(\\vec x,n,y)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\\\\n&\\hspace{48mm}\\Longrightarrow((\\vec x,n+1),h(\\vec x,n,y))\\in H\\bigr)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h)&:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{graph}(\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h))\\coloneqq\\Gamma_{g,h}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f(\\vec x,0)=g(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\vec x,n+1)=h(\\vec x,n,f(\\vec x,n))","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{g,h}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"g,h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h)","display":false},{"tex":"g,h","display":false}],"bytes":1774,"backlinks":[{"id":"cc110e19a2eae4ea","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecOp}_k$ (recursion operator, see [[92-df-recursion-operator]])"},{"id":"4fc9a0dac5607f3b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecOp}_k$ (recursion operator, see [[92-df-recursion-operator]])"},{"id":"bb38790ef6a3828c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"coun